  "about": "Hand-labelled ground truth for the fact placement probe (docs/superpowers/probes/2026-10-22-fact-placement.md), written and committed before any model call. World: the owner's acceptance snapshot. Each entry is judged at accept time: the world as it stood the revision before its expansion (`rev_before`), so a fact can only restate what existed then. Fact ids are 8-hex prefixes of the store's fact ids.",
