    "home": "acceptable homes, first is the primary: \"this\" (the entry being written), an existing entry's name, or \"new:<name>:<kind>\" for an entry that doesn't exist yet. Two entries that are one thing (Ashenmere / The Ashenmere Caves) are both acceptable.",
    "restates": "strict: the fact's claim is already in the world (adding an example or a small detail still counts). The ids are the existing facts it restates; any one of them caught counts.",
    "partial": "overlaps an existing fact but adds a real new claim: catching it is not a miss and not a false flag, missing it is not a miss.",
    "timeline": "null: no dated event. A list: the spheres whose timeline the event belongs on (any one counts). timeline_required false: null is also accepted (an event restated, or an event with no year).",
